E V E R S I O N

            A 2D tile-based cross-platform RPG engine.
               Contact: fdarkangel openconsole.net

       Sorry, I couldn't find much more info about this one.    
   However the engine is cute, put it to good use and make some 
              Zelda clones for AmigaOS 4.0 with it!

